<span>*** START OF THE PROJECT GUTENBERG EBOOK ΑΘΑΝΆΣΗΣ ΔΙΆΚΟΣ - ΑΣΤΡΑΠΌΓΙΑΝΝΟΣ ***</span>
</div></header><p id="id00000">Produced by Sophia Canoni. First two corrections by George</p>

